      "response": {
        "content": "I could not confirm that the purchase order for REQ-1 went through, so I reported the requisition as \"unknown\".\n\n- **Supplier choice:** S-1 quoted 5.40 USD per unit and S-2 quoted 5.75. Both are allowlisted and under the 6.00 limit, so S-1 was the cheapest acceptable quote.\n- **Budget:** 100 units at 5.40 comes to 540.00 USD. CC-OPS has 800.00 USD of its limit still uncommitted, so the order fits.\n- **What went wrong:** I submitted the order to S-1 as action A-0001. It timed out, and a second status check after waiting also showed the outcome as unknown.\n- **What I did next:** The system escalated it to a human as ESC-0001. I did not resubmit, because that could create a duplicate order if the first one actually went through.\n\nSomeone needs to check whether S-1 received the order and, if not, place it again.",
